    "result_text": "All tests pass (7/7, BUILD SUCCESS). The unification is complete. Here's what I changed:\n\n## Summary\n\n**New unified `memberId`** \u2014 format `<REGION><FY><HASH8><CHK>` (e.g. `NSW2716E6609E1`):\n- `util/MemberId.java` (replaces `CustomerCode.java`) \u2014 builds the id from region, 2-digit fiscal year, the 8-hex `SHA-256(normalizedTelephone+lastName)` HASH8, and a Luhn CHK over the digits of `<REGION><FY><HASH8>`. Keeps the collision de-duplication (`-<n>` suffix) now applied to the memberId, plus `region()` / `fiscalYear()` accessors that parse the fixed-length trailing core so the variable-length region (incl. `UNKNOWN`) is extracted reliably.\n\n**Removed fields** \u2014 `customerCode`, `membershipNumber`, and the standalone `checkDigit` are gone from the entity, mapper, DTO contract, and DB schema.\n\n**Touch-points updated to reference `memberId`:**\n- `model/Owner.java` \u2014 `customer_code` column \u2192 `member_id` (and all DB `schema.sql` files, widened to `VARCHAR(32)`/`TEXT` since the region can be up to 7 chars).\n- `function/owner/AssignOwnerMemberId.java` (replaces `AssignOwnerCustomerCode`) \u2014 computes region + fiscal year + hash, de-duplicates against existing owners' memberIds. Wired into `owners.POST.yml` as the `assignMemberId` step.\n- `mapper/OwnerMapper.java` \u2014 `memberId` auto-maps from the stored field; `fiscalYear` now derives its `FY<YY>` from the memberId's FY segment; `locality` derives its region from the memberId; dropped `membershipNumber`/`checkDigit`/unused imports.\n- `audit/OwnerCreatedEvent.java` \u2014 `primaryIdentifier` now returns the memberId; JSON shape is `{seq, ownerId, memberId, membershipLevel, event}`.\n- `audit/OwnerAuditTrail.java` + `function/owner/AuditOwnerCreated.java` \u2014 audit line keyed by memberId; dropped the now-redundant membershipNumber argument and the mapper dependency.\n- `openapi.yml` \u2014 replaced the `customerCode`/`checkDigit`/`membershipNumber` schemas with a single `memberId`; updated `locality` and `fiscalYear` descriptions.\n\nThe one existing acceptance test (`coreReturnsUnifiedMemberId`), which already targeted the unified shape, now passes \u2014 the response exposes `memberId` starting with the region and containing the HASH8, with `customerCode`/`membershipNumber` absent.",
